# Feature 5: GoReleaser Configuration - COMPLETED

## Summary
Created .goreleaser.yaml for multi-platform binary releases with ldflags version injection.

## Changes Made

### 1. Created cmd/skillrunner/main.go
- Added main package entry point that was missing from the project
- Calls `commands.Execute()` to start the CLI

### 2. Created .goreleaser.yaml
- **Project name**: skillrunner
- **Binary name**: sr
- **Platforms**: darwin/linux x amd64/arm64
- **CGO**: Enabled (required for SQLite)

### 3. Ldflags Configuration
Injects the following variables at build time:
- `github.com/jbctechsolutions/skillrunner/internal/presentation/cli/commands.Version` - Git tag version
- `github.com/jbctechsolutions/skillrunner/internal/presentation/cli/commands.GitCommit` - Short commit SHA
- `github.com/jbctechsolutions/skillrunner/internal/presentation/cli/commands.BuildDate` - Build timestamp

### 4. Release Features
- **Archives**: tar.gz format with README.md, LICENSE, CHANGELOG.md
- **Checksums**: SHA256 checksums.txt file
- **Changelog**: Auto-generated from conventional commits, grouped by type (Features, Bug Fixes, etc.)
- **GitHub Release**: Auto-generated release notes with installation instructions
- **Homebrew**: Auto-updates homebrew-skillrunner tap at jbctechsolutions/homebrew-skillrunner

## Files Created
- cmd/skillrunner/main.go
- .goreleaser.yaml

## Notes
- The config uses `--single-target` flag in CI for native per-platform builds (CGO requirement)
- Homebrew formula uses HOMEBREW_TAP_GITHUB_TOKEN environment variable
- Build strips debug symbols (-s -w) for smaller binaries

## Blockers
None - feature complete.
